sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.10) Browsers
    participant UI as Teacher · compass dialog<br/>session-host
    participant S as Participants
  end
  box rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.10) App server · backend
    participant R as tRPC qa router
    participant P as prepare<br/>context build
    participant Q as qaSummaryQueue
    participant C as Adapter + LLM client
  end
  box rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.10) Data
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / Redis
  end
  box rgba(13, 148, 136, 0.10) Second private host
    participant L as llama-server
  end

  UI->>R: qa.requestSummary(sessionId, locale)
  alt no session · bad token · post-session window over · Q&A or summary disabled
    R-->>UI: TRPCError NOT_FOUND / UNAUTHORIZED / FORBIDDEN
  else allowed
  R->>Q: requestQaSummary
  alt job already inflight
    Q-->>R: current pending result, no prepare
    R-->>UI: runtime DTO
  else no job inflight
  Q->>P: prepare (1)
  P->>DB: 8 authorization fences + data reads (RepeatableRead)
  S-)DB: meanwhile: Q&A vote · new question · join
  Note over UI,S: the host may also advance the quiz meanwhile
  alt fenced field changed during the build (e.g. Q&A vote, new question, join, quiz step), or a schema violation
    P-->>R: CONFLICT or INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR
    R-->>UI: TRPCError · frontend shows no result
  else build ok
    Note over P: pack into budget · snapshotHash ·<br/>strict parse QaSummaryInferenceRequestV2
    P-->>Q: prepared context · hash (1)
    alt too few questions
      Q-->>R: stored result (same hash) or rule-based context_unavailable
    else cooldown hit (same hash, not failed)
      Q-->>R: stored result
    else queue full (default 8, all sessions)
      Q-->>R: extractive fallback queue_full
    else accepted
      Note over Q: pending result + job · copy host token
      Q-->>R: status pending
    end
    R-->>UI: runtime DTO · request did not wait for the model
  end
  end
  end

  par teacher polls while the job runs
    loop every 750 ms while pending
      UI->>R: qa.summaryRuntime
      R-->>UI: pending (no prepare while pending)
    end
  and asynchronous job
    Note over Q: pump: the job starts when no other job runs<br/>(default concurrency 1, all sessions)
    Q->>P: prepare (2) · re-authorize with the copied token
    P-->>Q: prepared · hash (2)
    Note over Q,C: queue timeout starts (default 90 s)
    Q->>C: runPreparedQaSummary(prepared)
    alt plan none · no packed Q&A text · legacy-text
      C-->>Q: no open-weight call (fallback reason or legacy run)
    else gates fail: misconfigured · circuit open · slot busy in process
      C-->>Q: failure status, no network call
    else gates pass
      C->>L: GET /slots?fail_on_no_slot=1 (Bearer)
      L-->>C: 200 · 503 busy · 401/403/501 misconfigured
      C->>L: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>instruction · definition · context JSON · JSON schema
      L-->>C: JSON answer
      Note over C: parseCompletion: schema + known source IDs<br/>failure → invalid_response · client timeout → timeout
      C-->>Q: model output or failure status
    end
    S-)DB: meanwhile: Q&A vote · new question · join
    Note over UI,S: or the host deletes or moderates a question
    Q->>P: prepare (3) · re-authorize · re-reads all data
    P-->>Q: hash (3)
    alt hash (2) ≠ hash (3)
      Note over Q: extractive fallback source_changed
    else queue timeout fired
      Note over Q: extractive fallback timeout
    else run result
      Note over Q: bind to prepare (3): drop unknown source IDs<br/>no statement left → uncertain
    end
    Note over Q: clear the copied host token
  end

  UI->>R: qa.summaryRuntime (also on page load and dialog open)
  R->>Q: getQaSummaryRuntimeFresh
  Q->>P: prepare (4)
  alt prepare (4) fails, e.g. CONFLICT
    P-->>R: TRPCError
    R-->>UI: error · frontend sets the runtime to null, result disappears
  else hash unchanged
    P-->>Q: current hash
    Q-->>R: stored result (model summary or fallback)
    R-->>UI: final runtime DTO · polling stops
  else hash changed since the result
    P-->>Q: current hash
    Q-->>R: replaced by extractive source_changed
    R-->>UI: final runtime DTO · polling stops
  end
